./docs/articles/new-expensify/expenses-&-payments/Duplicate-detection.md:70:If Concierge lets you know it has flagged a receipt as a duplicate, scanning the receipt again will trigger the same duplicate flagging. You can still find these in the [deleted](https://www.expensify.com/expenses?reportStatusList=Deleted) filter on Expensify Classic.
